[2.147885, "o", "demo on tailnet demo.tw.test (apps in /tmp/tw-demo-hs/apps). It will:\r\n  - add tagOwners for the two apps' tags to the tailnet policy (tw policy --apply; additive)\r\n"]
[2.147907, "o", "  - add these grants if they are missing:\r\n"]
[2.450969, "o", "      + {\"src\": [\"autogroup:member\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo-agent\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"]}\r\n      + {\"src\": [\"tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"], \"app\": {\"example.com/cap/mcp\":[{\"limits\":{\"refund\":{\"maxUsd\":50,\"perDayUsd\":200}},\"tools\":[\"lookup_order\",\"refund\"]}]}}\r\n"]
[2.452062, "o", "  - deploy workloads demo (template mcp) and demo-agent (template agent)\r\n"]
[2.4521, "o", "  - take \"refund\" out of the grant tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent → tag:tw-wl-demo for a few seconds, then put it back\r\n  - kill the agent object it created (demo-080104)\r\nNothing else in the policy is touched. Undo: scripts/demo.sh --tailnet demo.tw.test --cleanup\r\n"]
[6.466289, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n\u001b[1m# 1. tailworks is up: one process on this machine, on tailnet demo.tw.test\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m$ tw status\u001b[0m\r\n"]
