[10.526954, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n\u001b[1m# 2. An MCP server and an agent, from the templates (Agents SDK and MCP, unmodified)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.527031, "o", "\u001b[1m$ tw init demo --template mcp\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.542096, "o", "✓ created /tmp/tw-demo-hs/apps/demo from template mcp (workload \"demo\")\r\n"]
[10.542199, "o", "  tags: tag:tw-wl-demo (tw policy prints what to add to your tailnet policy for them)\r\n  cd demo && tw policy && tw deploy   # or `tw dev` for a local run with no tailnet\r\n"]
[10.543317, "o", "\u001b[1m$ tw init demo-agent --template agent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.557365, "o", "✓ created /tmp/tw-demo-hs/apps/demo-agent from template agent (workload \"demo-agent\")\r\n"]
[10.557466, "o", "  tags: tag:tw-demo-agent-lookup-agent, tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent, tag:tw-wl-demo-agent (tw policy prints what to add to your tailnet policy for them)\r\n  cd demo-agent && tw policy && tw deploy   # or `tw dev` for a local run with no tailnet\r\n"]
[14.570547, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n\u001b[1m# 3. The tailnet policy: the apps' tags, who may call the agent, which tools the agent may call\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.570617, "o", "\u001b[1m$ tw policy demo --apply --yes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.708981, "o", "tw policy: what demo needs in tenant demo.tw.test's tailnet policy (nothing is deployed)\r\n✗ tagOwners  tag:tw-wl-demo: missing (minting its nodes would fail)\r\n? callers    not checked: tailworks doesn't know who you want to allow to call demo\r\n\r\n"]
[14.775856, "o", "› policy     tailworks will add to the tailnet policy (additive: only tag:tw* entries, nothing removed or changed):\r\n    + \"tagOwners\": {\r\n    +   \"tag:tw-wl-demo\": [\"tag:tw\"],\r\n    + },\r\n"]
[15.257721, "o", "✓ policy     applied (validated by the control plane; tw audit --all shows it as policy_apply)\r\n\r\nThe policy now has everything tailworks checks; run tw deploy. If people should call demo, make sure a grant like this exists (tailworks never writes who may call an app):\r\n\r\n  \"grants\": [\r\n    { \"src\": [\"autogroup:member\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"] }, // who may call it (not checked: narrow src to a user, group or tag)\r\n  ],\r\n"]
[15.259919, "o", "\u001b[1m$ tw policy demo-agent --apply --yes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.369343, "o", "tw policy: what demo-agent needs in tenant demo.tw.test's tailnet policy (nothing is deployed)\r\n  tags       tag:tw-demo-agent-lookup-agent (the LookupAgent objects' nodes), tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent (the SupportAgent objects' nodes), tag:tw-wl-demo-agent (the workload node)\r\n✗ tagOwners  tag:tw-demo-agent-lookup-agent, tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent, tag:tw-wl-demo-agent: missing (minting its nodes would fail)\r\n? callers    not checked: tailworks doesn't know who you want to allow to call demo-agent\r\n\r\n"]
[15.460044, "o", "› policy     tailworks will add to the tailnet policy (additive: only tag:tw* entries, nothing removed or changed):\r\n    + \"tagOwners\": {\r\n"]
[15.46005, "o", "    +   \"tag:tw-demo-agent-lookup-agent\": [\"tag:tw\"],\r\n    +   \"tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent\": [\"tag:tw\"],\r\n    +   \"tag:tw-wl-demo-agent\": [\"tag:tw\"],\r\n    + },\r\n"]
[16.297709, "o", "✓ policy     applied (validated by the control plane; tw audit --all shows it as policy_apply)\r\n\r\nThe policy now has everything tailworks checks; run tw deploy. If people should call demo-agent, make sure a grant like this exists (tailworks never writes who may call an app):\r\n\r\n  \"grants\": [\r\n    { \"src\": [\"autogroup:member\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo-agent\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"] }, // who may call it (not checked: narrow src to a user, group or tag)\r\n  ],\r\n"]
[16.30066, "o", "\u001b[2m  tw adds tags, never callers. The two grants of this demo:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.358205, "o", "+ {\"src\": [\"autogroup:member\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo-agent\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"]}\r\n+ {\"src\": [\"tag:tw-demo-agent-support-agent\"], \"dst\": [\"tag:tw-wl-demo\"], \"ip\": [\"tcp:80\"], \"app\": {\"example.com/cap/mcp\":[{\"limits\":{\"refund\":{\"maxUsd\":50,\"perDayUsd\":200}},\"tools\":[\"lookup_order\",\"refund\"]}]}}\r\n"]
[16.717841, "o", "policy written to demo.tw.test (validated, If-Match)\r\n"]
